{"unit_id":"AK-blank__dsh-plugin-mac-notify#feature-1","repo":"AK-blank/dsh-plugin-mac-notify","commit":"a9ef9439a1e8f7957a402c742bc639919ab1d1c8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-mac-notify 的功能「会话状态提醒」：在 DSH 一轮结束或发生错误时发送 macOS 通知，完成提醒可附上最近的助手回复。监听器根据事件更新会话状态并生成通知内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:650-671","lib/index.js:776-795"]}
